{
  "key": "letter-143-part-01",
  "number": 143,
  "generationId": "01a1e6d5-9d4c-703d-a965-b6b72b24734c",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love and blessings.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.107732
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Live the truth, for there is no other way to find it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.314286,
      "end": 5.4010430000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Become the truth, for there is no other way to know it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/03.mp3",
      "start": 6.656236,
      "end": 9.773468999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "You cannot know truth through words, not through the scriptures, nor through learning, study, contemplation.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.060862,
      "end": 18.063447
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Truth is within, in the emptiness within.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/05.mp3",
      "start": 19.265828,
      "end": 21.780181000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "In the state of no-mind in the mind free of desires where only awareness is, there truth manifests itself.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/06.mp3",
      "start": 23.024354,
      "end": 28.688707
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Truth simply is; it has not to be found, simply uncovered.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.943832,
      "end": 33.742902
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The lid of gold covering it is the ego.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/08.mp3",
      "start": 34.999252000000006,
      "end": 37.325193
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Ego is darkness; die, and become light!",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/09.mp3",
      "start": 38.932971,
      "end": 43.478888999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Where the darkness of the ego is no more there, in that emptiness, truth is; and that is truth, and that is bliss, and that is immortality.",
      "path": "audio/1970-143/10.mp3",
      "start": 45.087392,
      "end": 56.37
    }
  ]
}
